      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Richardson's older ranch-house streets, alley fences and mature trees make fence jobs less simple than a catalog price. Call now and describe yours, then compare two or three written quotes.</p>
